    new version. The hardened malloc requires we use clang 20 and specifically
    allowing the MADV_DONRNEED_LOCKED allow.
    
    Cygwin is pulling in the dev version of 3.7 so we are pinning it to the
    release version where it was working before. The dev version seems to have
    an issue causing this to fail on the first connection attempt.
    This will need to be changed once we get this to pass.

